          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.3,
            0.836,
            0.391
          ],
          "content": "We are quite familiar with number lines now. Let’s see if we can place some numbers in their appropriate positions on the number line. Here are the numbers: 2180, 2754, 1500, 3600, 9950, 9590, 1050, 3050, 5030, 5300 and 8400."
